# Do not reload the browser from the agent

Do not hard-reload the Cursor-owned HA tab or the Cursor window from the agent. Agent-triggered reloads (CDP `Page.reload`, `location.reload()`, navigate that forces a full Cursor/glass rebuild, etc.) can reload the **whole Cursor window**.

## Do this instead

- Ask the user to **hard-refresh the page** (Ctrl+Shift+R / Cmd+Shift+R) when new panel JS (`/api/scene_extrapolation/assets/…/panel.js`) or a Lovelace module must be picked up.
- Prefer measuring/interacting with the already-open tab; do not reload it yourself.
- Only use in-page navigation that stays inside the HA SPA if the user already has the sandbox tab open and a soft route change is enough — never a full reload/restart of the browser target.
